add('squarewave','Terms Time','Value','[4/Math.PI*Array.from({length:p[0]},(_,k)=>Math.sin(2*Math.PI*(2*k+1)*p[1])/(2*k+1)).reduce((a,b)=>a+b,0)]',lambda p:[4/math.pi*sum(math.sin(2*math.pi*(2*k+1)*p[1])/(2*k+1) for k in range(int(p[0])))],'Use Terms {Terms} odd harmonics of a unit square wave at Time {Time}. What truncated Fourier-series value results?','More odd harmonics sharpen the transition while oscillations remain near the discontinuity. The displayed curve is a finite partial sum.','p[0]<1||p[0]>100||!Number.isInteger(p[0])',[1,0,1])
